ame": "MRPool_meta_screenshot_2560x1440_5.png", "id": "700958614821408", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75334060_700958618154741_841056018972498732_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vQgRaL-6TO0Q7kNvwFUFOEN&_nc_oc=AdnLFCDgTqgLs5bpY8wgo5wCdaEs6OIPFkPhdZhspOulQny5uPYcp1oAr_Jap34yNn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyuTGGrFiW41zWwb3su09hwRTga2JoB_XtBh5xuWLOdtw&oe=69BEAAFC"}, {"file_name": "MRPool_meta_screenshot_2560x1440_3.png", "id": "862915232024955", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982528_862915235358288_8848225477585209988_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a5ZZQpakyggQ7kNvwHBl1xW&_nc_oc=AdnPdmD2D6K2ED-YNh3os5KTcBpPBHrepRyVMDRANk0-rS4FGHhTNKv74LKfyIE9C8w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyqw3XLn7XDxwqFHuK6VDiHzGt8H0u3K79ue8Q6TSt5Hw&oe=69BEAAC5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MiRacle Pool", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Have you ever dreamed about having a pool table in your home? Now you can!\n\nThanks to Mixed Reality and Miracle Pool, you can place a virtual Pool Table in your home, walk around, and shoot some balls. You can also play against friends or against other online players.\n\nThis is a room-scale-only experience and you must have plenty of space to use it. The minimum recommended play area is 3m x 4m (10 feet x 13 feet)\n\nFEATURES:\n- Practice alone (8Ball, 9Ball, 10Ball, practice drills)\n- Play against computer (8 Ball)\n- Play with friends (up to 4 players, no rules enforced)\n- Play ranked matches against random online opponents for ELO points (8 Ball)\n\nNOTE:\nThis is an early access version, and we reserve the rights to change pricing and feature sets.", "short_description": "Your own virtual Pool Table in Mixed Reality."}]}, "developer_name": "Pixel Works", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.pxlworks.io/mrpt_pp", "developer_terms_of_servic